WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:10,570
Mom, she doesn’t like to eat, give it all to me

2
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,740
You come in with me

3
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:25,440
Daughter-in-law, I forget my mother when I have a daughter-in-law

4
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:30,630
I'll go in and have a look
